stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: booking accepted
    PENDING --> HELD: Inventory hold succeeded
    PENDING --> FAILED: hold rejected / unrecoverable error
    HELD --> CONFIRMED: payment simulation succeeded + Inventory confirmed
    HELD --> FAILED: payment simulation failed
    HELD --> EXPIRED: Inventory hold expired
    HELD --> CANCELLED: customer cancels before payment
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
